# Rust build output (including target/ inside evaluation trial work directories)
target/
# Python caches and test-fixture caches
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
*.pyc
.venv/
# SQLite temporaries: evidence directories keep only the checkpointed main database
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm
# Local probes and scratch artifacts, TLC state directories and runtime state roots
# `/pi/` is the my-pi goal harness's own state (its STATUS.md and state.jsonl): agent state, not repository
# content, and `citations.py`/`decision_citations.py` read *untracked* files (D-443 — the goal's own check
# commands were being counted as the tree's `make` citations before this line existed).
/.pi/
# The SWE-bench harness writes its per-instance logs to `logs/run_evaluation/...` relative to cwd; the
# adapter now points that cwd at the run's own output directory, and this keeps a stray run out of the tree.
/logs/
/review/tmp/
/verification/tla/states/
/states/
